  Description: Prerequisite Region - Old Cheliax Your family, whether goblin, hobgoblin,
    or human, died in the Goblinblood Wars. Though you were marked by these losses,
    you managed to survive through your own resilience and resourcefulness. Choose
    two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Constitution , and one is a
    free attribute boost. You're trained in the Survival skill and the Goblin Lore
    skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Assurance] skill feat
    with Survival.
